":"He will deprive you","transliteration":"yalit'kum"},{"position":21,"text":"مِّنۡ","translation":"of","transliteration":"min"},{"position":22,"text":"أَعۡمَٰلِكُمۡ","translation":"your deeds","transliteration":"aʿmālikum"},{"position":23,"text":"شَيۡـًٔاۚ","translation":"anything","transliteration":"shayan"},{"position":24,"text":"إِنَّ","translation":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna"},{"position":25,"text":"ٱللَّهَ","translation":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha"},{"position":26,"text":"غَفُورٞ","translation":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun"},{"position":27,"text":"رَّحِيمٌ","translation":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun"}]},{"id":4627,"verseKey":"49:15","verseNumber":15,"arabic":"إِنَّمَا ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنُونَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ بِٱللَّهِ وَرَسُولِهِۦ ثُمَّ لَمۡ يَرۡتَابُواْ وَجَٰهَدُواْ بِأَمۡوَٰلِهِمۡ وَأَنفُسِهِمۡ فِي سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِۚ أُوْلَٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلصَّٰدِقُونَ","translation":"The believers are only the ones who have believed in Allāh and His Messenger and then doubt not but strive with their properties and their lives in the cause of Allāh. It is those who are the truthful.","transliteration":"innamā l-mu'minūna alladhīna āmanū bil-lahi warasūlihi thumma lam yartābū wajāhadū bi-amwālihim wa-anfusihim fī sabīli l-lahi ulāika humu l-ṣādiqūna","audioUrl":"/audio/7/049015.mp3","segments":[[0,1,80,1770],[1,2,1780,3280],[2,3,3290,4400],[3,4,4410,5440],[4,5,5450,6570],[5,6,6580,8000],[6,7,8010,9420],[7,8,9430,9810],[8,9,9820,14940],[9,10,14950,16200],[10,11,16210,17920],[11,12,17930,20080],[12,13,20090,20520],[13,14,20530,21540],[14,15,21550,23860],[15,16,23870,26380],[16,17,26390,26820],[17,18,26830,29710]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"إِنَّمَا","translation":"Only","transliteration":"innamā"},{"position":2,"text":"ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنُونَ","translation":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minūna"},{"position":3,"text":"ٱلَّذِينَ","translation":"(are) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna"},{"position":4,"text":"ءَامَنُواْ","translation":